{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788545759213885500,"compiled_state":{"alias":"alkalic-humourless-velvetworm","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"856f95365ea511fc634ea4a35115572a143e1029220d84de77131c6d771eabfc","event_uuid":"61fbffef-7b42-4dd2-8190-c856c5564ca5","position":{"commit_sha":"10bd87e2fbfe06d336719f4acf45127da51fe3cd","position":"1788543316414949168-61fbffef-7b42-4dd2-8190-c856c5564ca5"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"452f3e68b581c94f3a3f74e35abbd09f379379f306f081483b06c43765ea90f5","event_uuid":"02c1608f-431c-4852-a862-213a4a574033","position":{"commit_sha":"81990f3dfa5376458a29684edef7d857b091ea21","position":"1788543341001569657-02c1608f-431c-4852-a862-213a4a574033"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788543316414949168,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"02c1608f-431c-4852-a862-213a4a574033","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"2af9-0769-6f23-41a8"}],"description":"## Problem\n`make worktree name=<branch>` creates the branch/worktree, but if its delegated `make venv && make install` step fails, the recipe continues, prints “✓ worktree ready,” and exits 0.\n\nObserved when ambient `uv 0.12.9` violated the repository's `==0.12.7` pin: `make venv` failed and no `.venv` existed, yet the target reported success.\n\n## Expected\nThe target exits nonzero on any provisioning failure and does not print the success message.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A provisioning failure makes `make worktree` exit nonzero.\n- [ ] The success message is printed only after provisioning succeeds.\n- [ ] A regression test covers the failure path without leaving a worktree or branch behind.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["bootstrap","developer-experience","makefile"],"ticket_id":"1738-3816-caca-44a2","ticket_type":"bug","title":"make worktree reports success after provisioning failure","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["61fbffef-7b42-4dd2-8190-c856c5564ca5","02c1608f-431c-4852-a862-213a4a574033"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788545759213885500,"uuid":"dbfe61a6-4fa1-474a-8bd1-d6614088e388"}